{"type":"record","name":"LevelAbsorptionManualLine","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.cvdrelated","doc":"Topic futures.level-absorption.manual-line, one partition, key lineId. ADD carries price (finite, strictly positive), domain and drawnEpochMillis not after commandEpochMillis; an ADD may also carry priceHigh, which makes it a MANUAL_RANGE band [price, priceHigh] with priceHigh strictly above price; REMOVE carries only lineId, operation and commandEpochMillis (price, priceHigh, domain and drawnEpochMillis null). operation is exactly ADD or REMOVE and domain exactly ES or SPX (strings, because the canonical in-process bridge CanonicalJsonAvro carries no Avro enums); Avro cannot state those or the cross-field rules, so the consumer (level-absorption-service ManualCommandReader) rejects, counts and logs any command that breaks them; the producer (the web tier) validates before it writes.","fields":[{"name":"lineId","type":"string"},{"name":"operation","type":"string"},{"name":"price","type":["null",{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18,"optionsedge.api-number-type":"double"}],"default":null},{"name":"domain","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"drawnEpochMillis","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"commandEpochMillis","type":"long"},{"name":"priceHigh","type":["null",{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18,"optionsedge.api-number-type":"double"}],"doc":"Version 2 section 6.10 MANUAL_RANGE: an ADD that carries priceHigh draws a band [price, priceHigh] (price the low edge, strictly below priceHigh, same domain); absent on a line and on a REMOVE. The consumer (ManualCommandReader) rejects a priceHigh that is not strictly above price, one on a REMOVE, and one in another domain.","default":null}]}